cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, cite the paper it belongs to; the software entry is here so the exact version is citable."
title: "certis: artifact for When Does Band Retrieval Pay? Scope, Density, and a Measured Floor for Retroactive Rule Evaluation"
abstract: >-
  Scripts, stored runs and assertion file behind every number in the paper. reproduce.py
  re-derives the values that do not need the corpus and compares them against expected.json;
  the corpus-dependent steps fetch 27 published CMS release files and verify their SHA-256.
